  "published": "2026-10-13T07:54:53.27Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release (0.1.0).\n\nTargets netstandard2.0, net8.0 and net10.0, with no dependencies on other packages or on any persistence technology.\n\nDomain (CSStack.DDD.Domain):\n- IValueObject and ISingleValueObject: value objects with equality by attributes. Implement them with records.\n- IEntity and Entity: entities with equality by identifier. Equals and GetHashCode are sealed in the base class, which also provides the == and != operators.\n- IAggregateRoot and AggregateRoot: aggregate roots that record domain events with AddDomainEvent.\n- IDomainEvent and IDomainEventSource: domain events with an ID and an occurrence time, and a non-generic interface for collecting them from any aggregate with PullDomainEvents.\n- IRepository and IDeletableRepository: repositories with FindAsync and Save, and Delete in a separate interface. Changes are applied when the unit of work commits.\n- IValidatable, ValidationError and DomainValidationException: validation that reports typed errors with member paths (for example, \"Address.PostalCode\").\n- Built-in validation errors: Required, InvalidFormat, TooLong, TooShort and OutOfRange.\n- ValidationErrorExtensions: Under to prefix error paths, and ThrowIfInvalid to throw DomainValidationException when any error exists.\n\nApplication (CSStack.DDD.Application):\n- IUnitOfWork: commits all registered changes in a single transaction with CommitAsync.\n- ConcurrencyConflictException: a common exception for concurrency conflicts detected by the infrastructure.\n\nDocumentation: https://github.com/Uta-member/CSStack.DDD/tree/master/docs/en",
